  message: "Phase 2 implementation submitted via auto-pr from branch jgstern-agent/feat/preface-precedence-gate. Adds _extract_preface (regex-based, anchored-at-char-0, no internal whitespace, must close with ]]), _call_openrouter (mistral-small-3.2 via OpenRouter, 16-token max, fail-soft on network/JSON/key errors), _precedence_gate (skips LLM when no other unreads; YES-prefixed case-insensitive response required to elevate; any exception → False), and integration into _build_reply_first_guidance (lifts elevated items into '## Escalated (preface precedence gate → YES)' section at top, removes them from the regular blocking/non-blocking listings). Tests cover all four acceptance criteria: preface accept/reject, gate YES/NO/empty/exception and prompt well-formedness, ambiguous prefaces still invoking the gate, fallback-when-gate-declines. 100% coverage in package isolation verified. Will close with PR reference once auto-pr merges."  # 61b0
