  message: "Closed as done: Phase 2 shipped in PR #3122 (merged to dev). All four acceptance criteria from the item description met: (1) [[preface]] detector anchored at char 0 with no-whitespace / must-close rules, single codepath regardless of tag semantics; (2) LLM-mediated precedence gate via OpenRouter that fires only when other unreads exist; (3) fallback to Phase 1 equal-priority listing when gate declines or fails; (4) tests for accept/reject, gate YES/NO/empty/exception, prompt well-formedness, ambiguous-preface still invokes gate, fallback-when-gate-declines. OpenRouter network access remains covered by existing ALLOWED_WEBSITES.md entry. No governance file changes were required — all logic lives in stop_hook.py."  # 4b40
